WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.133 --> 00:00:03.236
&gt;&gt; AFTER THE RELEASE OF
THAT AFFIDAVIT I SAT DOWN AND

00:00:03.236 --> 00:00:07.474
SPOKE WITH STEVE GONCALVES, HE
IS THE FATHER OF ONE OF THE

00:00:07.474 --> 00:00:10.777
VICTIMS, KAYLEE GONCALVES.
HE WAS DEFIANT, STILL GRIEVING.

00:00:10.777 --> 00:00:19.052
HERE IS WHAT HE SAID IT WAS LIKE
TO SEE THE SUSPECT IN COURT

00:00:19.052 --> 00:00:21.988
FACE-TO-FACE.
&gt;&gt; STEVE, YOU KNOW, THERE'S SO

00:00:21.988 --> 00:00:26.059
MUCH OF WHAT HAS TO BE JUST
UPSETTING INFORMATION SEEING

00:00:26.059 --> 00:00:29.696
THIS ARREST AFFIDAVIT NOW.
MY FIRST QUESTION IS, AS ALWAYS,

00:00:29.696 --> 00:00:33.766
JUST HOW ARE YOU AND YOUR FAMILY
DOING?

00:00:33.766 --> 00:00:38.838
&gt;&gt; WELL, IT'S A BIT OF A
NARRATIVE CHANGE.

00:00:38.838 --> 00:00:43.343
YOU GO FROM HUNTING, HUNTING,
LOOKING, POKING, LIKE YOU ALWAYS

00:00:43.343 --> 00:00:46.279
SEE THESE SHOWS WHERE IT'S
SOMEBODY THAT YOU KNOW, SOMEBODY

00:00:46.279 --> 00:00:51.617
CLOSE, SOMEBODY YOU TRUST.
I HAD A HARD TIME WITH THAT

00:00:51.617 --> 00:00:56.222
BECAUSE KAYLEE WAS SO KIND TO
PEOPLE.

00:00:56.222 --> 00:01:00.760
SHE WAS ORNERY TO HER BROTHERS
AND SISTERS, BUT FOR ALL

00:01:00.760 --> 00:01:05.265
OUTWARDS APPEARANCES SHE WAS A
VERY, VERY NICE PERSON.

00:01:05.265 --> 00:01:08.601
WE WERE PUZZLED BY, YOU KNOW --
WE JUST WOULDN'T -- WEREN'T

00:01:08.601 --> 00:01:12.838
READY FOR A BULLY STORY OR
SOMETHING ALONG THOSE LINES.

00:01:12.838 --> 00:01:18.044
SO YOU READ THE AFFIDAVIT AND
YOU JUST FIND OUT THAT NOBODY

00:01:18.044 --> 00:01:22.415
UNDERSTANDS EXACTLY WHY, BUT HE
WAS STALKING THEM, HE WAS

00:01:22.415 --> 00:01:27.220
HUNTING THEM, HE WAS JUST A
PERSON LOOKING FOR AN

00:01:27.220 --> 00:01:31.424
OPPORTUNITY AND IT JUST HAPPENED
TO BE IN THAT HOUSE.

00:01:31.424 --> 00:01:34.327
IT'S HARD TO TAKE.
IT'S VERY HARD TO TAKE.

00:01:34.327 --> 00:01:37.964
YOU KNOW, I'VE SAID THIS BEFORE,
I THOUGHT MAYBE I SHOULD HAVE

00:01:37.964 --> 00:01:42.101
PUT HER IN SOME GUN SAFETY
COURSES, HAVE DONE SOMETHING,

00:01:42.101 --> 00:01:45.871
BUT SHE HAD HER PHONE RIGHT NEXT
TO HER AND SHE COULDN'T CALL

00:01:45.871 --> 00:01:50.009
911, SO THESE WERE JUST GIRLS
THAT WENT TO SLEEP THAT NIGHT

00:01:50.009 --> 00:01:57.250
AND A COWARD, YOU KNOW, HUNTER
THAT WENT OUT AND HE PICKED HIS

00:01:57.250 --> 00:02:01.221
LITTLE OPPONENT THAT WAS GIRLS
AND THAT'S PROBABLY WHY THE

00:02:01.221 --> 00:02:05.325
HOUSE WAS TARGETED WAS BECAUSE
THERE WAS JUST GIRLS THERE AND

00:02:05.325 --> 00:02:10.162
IT ENDED UP BEING A LITTLE BIT
MORE OF A DIFFERENT CHALLENGE,

00:02:10.162 --> 00:02:15.768
DIFFERENT INSTANCE, HE WASN'T
PREPARED FOR, BUT I THINK THAT'S

00:02:15.768 --> 00:02:18.938
WHAT THE AFFIDAVIT SHOWS IS
SOMEBODY WHO WAS STALKING THE

00:02:18.938 --> 00:02:20.173
HOUSE.
&gt;&gt; GOODNESS.

00:02:20.173 --> 00:02:22.675
YEAH, THAT'S ONE THING THAT
STOOD OUT TO ME, THE IDEA THAT

00:02:22.675 --> 00:02:25.378
HIS CELLPHONE INFORMATION SHOWED
HE HAD BEEN IN THE AREA OF THE

00:02:25.378 --> 00:02:31.684
HOUSE AT LEAST 12 TIMES BEFORE.
DO YOU BELIEVE KOHBERGER WAS

00:02:31.684 --> 00:02:35.121
STALKING YOUR DAUGHTER IN
PARTICULAR OR JUST THE HOUSE

00:02:35.121 --> 00:02:37.724
ITSELF AND ALL THE FOLKS LIVING
THERE?

00:02:37.724 --> 00:02:40.526
&gt;&gt; NO, I DON'T THINK IT WAS
KAYLEE IN PARTICULAR.

00:02:40.526 --> 00:02:46.766
THERE'S OTHER DETAILS THAT WILL
COME OUT LATER ON, BUT I'VE

00:02:46.766 --> 00:02:51.771
ALWAYS SAID THIS TO MADDY'S
MOTHER AND HER FATHER THAT DOES

00:02:51.771 --> 00:02:53.806
IT REALLY MATTER?
I DON'T KNOW.

00:02:53.806 --> 00:02:59.579
MAYBE IN THE CASE IT DOES, BUT
TO US NONE OF THESE GIRLS

00:02:59.579 --> 00:03:04.017
DESERVED THIS.
I DON'T WANT A PARENT TO THINK

00:03:04.017 --> 00:03:08.054
THAT -- YOU KNOW, TO FEEL EVEN
WORSE WHEN YOU GO THROUGH THIS

00:03:08.054 --> 00:03:12.025
TO THINK THAT, OH, MY GIRL SAID
SOMETHING THAT CAUGHT HIM OFF

00:03:12.025 --> 00:03:14.594
GUARD AND THEN THESE OTHER
PEOPLE ARE JUST A PART OF THAT.

00:03:14.594 --> 00:03:17.630
THAT'S A CANCER INSIDE YOU AND
I'M NOT GOING TO LET THAT

00:03:17.630 --> 00:03:19.632
HAPPEN.
I'M GOING TO TRY TO KEEP MY

00:03:19.632 --> 00:03:21.534
FAMILY FROM THINKING ANYTHING
LIKE THAT.

00:03:21.534 --> 00:03:25.605
THE REAL PROBLEM WE HAVE IS WE
HAVE AN INDIVIDUAL THAT THOUGHT

00:03:25.605 --> 00:03:29.575
IT WAS OKAY TO, YOU KNOW, ATTACK
OTHER HUMAN BEINGS.

00:03:29.575 --> 00:03:31.077
THAT'S WHAT I'M GOING TO FOCUS
ON.

00:03:31.077 --> 00:03:34.747
&gt;&gt; OF COURSE.
AND THEN THAT'S GOT TO BE JUST A

00:03:34.747 --> 00:03:41.020
BRUTAL THOUGHT TO LIVE WITH.
WAS THERE ANY SENSE -- HAVE YOU

00:03:41.020 --> 00:03:45.725
BEEN TOLD IF THERE WAS ANY
CONTACT BETWEEN KOHBERGER AND

00:03:45.725 --> 00:03:50.263
THEM PRIOR TO THIS, OR WAS HE
JUST SURVEILLING THEM FROM AFAR?

00:03:50.263 --> 00:03:54.166
&gt;&gt; I DON'T HAVE ANY PINPOINT
INFORMATION THAT I CAN SHARE

00:03:54.166 --> 00:03:57.003
THAT WOULD SAY THAT THEY WERE
DIRECTLY IN CONTACT.

00:03:57.003 --> 00:03:59.906
THERE'S DEFINITELY RUMOR MILLS
OUT THERE THAT SAY THAT THERE'S

00:03:59.906 --> 00:04:03.176
GOING TO BE MORE INFORMATION.
WE CAN ALMOST GUARANTEE THAT

00:04:03.176 --> 00:04:07.480
THERE'S GOING TO BE MORE DETAILS
THAT ARE GOING TO BE BROUGHT IN.

00:04:07.480 --> 00:04:12.952
I WOULD BE A LITTLE BIT
SURPRISED IF THERE WASN'T A

00:04:12.952 --> 00:04:16.522
CLEAR TOUCH POINT THAT WOULD
SUGGEST THAT HE WAS INTERESTED

00:04:16.522 --> 00:04:23.863
IN ONE OR TWO OF THE PEOPLE MORE
THAN HE WAS THE OTHERS, BUT AT

00:04:23.863 --> 00:04:29.969
THIS POINT IN TIME WE HAVE -- WE
HAVE ENOUGH IN THAT AFFIDAVIT TO

00:04:29.969 --> 00:04:33.773
BELIEVE THAT THIS DEFENDANT HAS
A LOT TO EXPLAIN.

00:04:33.773 --> 00:04:37.109
&gt;&gt; YEAH.
NO QUESTION.

00:04:37.109 --> 00:04:41.347
HE'S OF COURSE INNOCENT UNTIL
PROVEN GUILTY, NATURE OF OUR

00:04:41.347 --> 00:04:43.616
JUSTICE SYSTEM.
&gt;&gt; I AGREE.

00:04:43.616 --> 00:04:46.719
&gt;&gt; HAVE INVESTIGATORS SHARED
WITH YOU ANY INDICATION AS TO A

00:04:46.719 --> 00:04:52.291
POSSIBLE MOTIVE?
&gt;&gt; NO, WE HAVEN'T GOT DOWN

00:04:52.291 --> 00:04:56.028
THAT -- I KNOW THAT I'M SUPPOSED
TO BE DOING AN INTERVIEW WITH

00:04:56.028 --> 00:05:01.500
THEM, SHANNON IS PUTTING THAT
TOGETHER AND COORDINATING THAT.

00:05:01.500 --> 00:05:04.237
SO THAT MAY BE SOMETHING THAT
COMES UP, BUT THEY'RE VERY

00:05:04.237 --> 00:05:07.306
CAREFUL AND I'VE TOLD THEM DON'T
TELL ME SOMETHING THAT PUTS ME

00:05:07.306 --> 00:05:11.711
IN A SITUATION WHERE I MAY
DISCLOSE SOMETHING THAT COULD

00:05:11.711 --> 00:05:15.415
HURT THE CASE.
&gt;&gt; ALSO IN THE AFFIDAVIT IT SAYS

00:05:15.415 --> 00:05:22.321
THAT THE ROOMMATE, SURVIVING
ROOMMATE, IDENTIFIED JUST BY THE

00:05:22.321 --> 00:05:24.123
KMIS
INITIALS DM. SAYS SHE HEARD

00:05:24.123 --> 00:05:26.559
CRYING COMING FROM ONE OF THE
ROOMS, SAW A MAN DRESSED IN

00:05:26.559 --> 00:05:28.928
BLACK WITH A MASK ON WALK PAST
HERE.

00:05:28.928 --> 00:05:36.235
DO WE KNOW WHY POLICE WERE NOT
CALLED UNTIL SEVERAL HOURS AFTER

00:05:36.235 --> 00:05:39.138
THAT?
S&gt;&gt; WE DON'T HAVE THOSE DETAILS.

00:05:39.138 --> 00:05:47.747
I DO KNOW THAT SHE WAS PETRIFIED
AND I THINK PEOPLE RESPOND A

00:05:47.747 --> 00:05:51.617
LITTLE BIT DIFFERENT.
I DON'T WANT TO MAKE HER A

00:05:51.617 --> 00:05:56.923
VICTIM AND I DON'T -- PEOPLE ARE
MEAN, THEY WILL GO AFTER PEOPLE

00:05:56.923 --> 00:06:00.827
AND I SAY DON'T DO IT, MY NAME,
MY FAMILY NAME.

00:06:00.827 --> 00:06:09.101
I THINK SHE WAS JUST SCARED.
VERY SCARED AND IT'S NOT LIKE

00:06:09.101 --> 00:06:11.804
WHERE EVERYONE BEHAVES LIKE
PEOPLE THINK THEY WOULD.

00:06:11.804 --> 00:06:13.840
EVENTUALLY WE WILL GET ALL THE
DETAILS AND WE WILL UNDERSTAND A

00:06:13.840 --> 00:06:15.341
LITTLE BIT MORE.
&gt;&gt; I GET IT.

00:06:15.341 --> 00:06:20.046
&gt;&gt; IT'S PROBABLY GOING TO BE --
&gt;&gt; PETRIFIED IS THE RIGHT WORD,

00:06:20.046 --> 00:06:22.114
I CAN UNDERSTAND.
I DO WANT TO ASK YOU BEFORE WE

00:06:22.114 --> 00:06:27.854
GO YOU WERE IN COURT, YOU HAD
THE CHANCE TO SEE KOHBERGER,

00:06:27.854 --> 00:06:31.023
PERHAPS TO LOOK HIM IN THE EYES.
WHAT WERE YOU FEELING AT THAT

00:06:31.023 --> 00:06:33.226
MOMENT?
&gt;&gt; I WAS PRETTY ANGRY.

00:06:33.226 --> 00:06:36.262
I WAS PRETTY HEATED.
I WANTED HIM TO LOOK ME IN THE

00:06:36.262 --> 00:06:38.564
EYE.
HE KNOWS I WANT HIM TO LOOK ME

00:06:38.564 --> 00:06:43.069
IN THE EYE SO HE'S -- HE DIDN'T.
HE DIDN'T GIVE ME THAT

00:06:43.069 --> 00:06:46.973
OPPORTUNITY WHEN HE WAS BACK IN
HIS HOME STATE OF PENNSYLVANIA,

00:06:46.973 --> 00:06:51.277
HE DID TURN AROUND AND LOOK FOR
HIS PARENTS AND NOT ME, HE

00:06:51.277 --> 00:06:55.081
DIDN'T GIVE ME THAT.
SO I THINK HE UNDERSTANDS THAT

00:06:55.081 --> 00:06:59.619
I'M NOT GOING TO SEE SOMETHING
IN HIS EYES THAT I WANT TO SEE,

00:06:59.619 --> 00:07:02.822
YOU KNOW.
I WANT TO SEE AN INNOCENT MAN,

00:07:02.822 --> 00:07:09.295
BUT I FEEL LIKE HE'S SCARED TO
LOOK AT ME IN THE EYES AND START

00:07:09.295 --> 00:07:12.264
TO UNDERSTAND WHAT'S ABOUT TO
HAPPEN TO HIM.

00:07:12.264 --> 00:07:16.736
YOU KNOW, HE PICKED THE WRONG
FAMILY AND I'M NOT SCARED OF A

00:07:16.736 --> 00:07:20.773
CONFLICT AND WE'RE NOT SCARED --
WE'RE NOT RUNNING.

00:07:20.773 --> 00:07:24.610
WE ARE COMING AT HIM AND THE
DEFENDANT HAS HIS HANDS FULL.

00:07:24.610 --> 00:07:28.748
&gt;&gt; DID YOU SENSE ANYTHING FROM
HIM, ANY EMOTION IN THAT MOMENT,

00:07:28.748 --> 00:07:30.549
IN THAT COURTROOM?
&gt;&gt; I DID.

00:07:30.549 --> 00:07:37.623
I SENSED SOMEBODY SHOCKED AND
SCARED AND NOT PREPARED.

00:07:37.623 --> 00:07:41.494
LIKE ALMOST LIKE THIS IS NOTHING
LIKE I THOUGHT IT WAS GOING TO

00:07:41.494 --> 00:07:45.932
BE.
SO HIS MANNERISMS, HIS BODY

00:07:45.932 --> 00:07:50.403
LANGUAGE -- I'M PRETTY IN TUNE
WITH CERTAIN GUYS, I PLAYED

00:07:50.403 --> 00:07:53.773
SPORTS MY WHOLE LIFE, I'VE BEEN
IN DIFFERENT GYMS, I'VE BEEN IN

00:07:53.773 --> 00:07:56.876
CONFERENCE ROOMS WITH WHITE
COLLAR.

00:07:56.876 --> 00:07:59.145
I CAN SENSE CONFIDENCE AND I DID
NOT SENSE THAT AT ALL.

00:07:59.145 --> 00:08:08.387
I SENSED SOMEBODY WHO WAS
FLARING, SCARED AND WORRIED.

00:08:08.387 --> 00:08:11.991
&gt;&gt; I TELL YOU, ERICA, I'VE BEEN
SPEAKING WITH STEVE FOR A NUMBER

00:08:11.991 --> 00:08:14.894
OF WEEKS NOW AND I SENSE -- YOU
COULD SEE IT THERE, YOU SENSE

00:08:14.894 --> 00:08:18.297
EXHAUSTION.
OF COURSE, WE WOULD BE HAVING

00:08:18.297 --> 00:08:22.768
LOST A CHILD THAT WAY, BUT ALSO
THIS WAS THE FIRST TIME I SENSED

00:08:22.768 --> 00:08:26.872
REALLY MORE RESOLVE THERE.
I THINK WHAT CAME ACROSS TO ME

00:08:26.872 --> 00:08:29.442
IS YOU HEARD HIM SAY THERE, HE
PICKED THE WRONG FAMILY.

00:08:29.442 --> 00:08:31.310
THE SUSPECT PICKED THE WRONG
FAMILY.

00:08:31.310 --> 00:08:38.284
THAT THERE IS A PATH TO JUSTICE
HERE, RIGHT, THAT HE WAS

00:08:38.284 --> 00:08:39.952
EXPRESSING, BUT STILL
HEARTBREAK.

00:08:39.952 --> 00:08:43.122
THE WAY HE DESCRIBED IT, THAT
HIS VIEW IS THAT THIS GUY WAS

00:08:43.122 --> 00:08:45.591
HUNTING -- HUNTING THOSE
VICTIMS.

00:08:45.591 --> 00:08:50.362
&gt;&gt; AND TO HEAR HIM TALK ABOUT,
YOU KNOW -- WE KNOW AS PARENTS,

00:08:50.362 --> 00:08:54.567
BUT TO IMAGINE AS A PARENT TO
HEAR HIM SAY MY DAUGHTER HAD HER

00:08:54.567 --> 00:08:57.770
PHONE RIGHT THERE AND SHE
COULDN'T EVEN CALL 911.

00:08:57.770 --> 00:09:01.374
HOW HELPLESS HE MUST FEEL.
I WAS ALSO JUST REALLY STRUCK BY

00:09:01.374 --> 00:09:04.343
HIS EMPATHY AND HIS GRACE AND I
THINK, AGAIN, JUST A TESTAMENT

00:09:04.343 --> 00:09:06.646
TO HIM AS A PARENT.
WHEN YOU ASKED HIM THE QUESTION

00:09:06.646 --> 00:09:09.949
A LOT OF PEOPLE HAVE ABOUT THE
ROOMMATE WHO ACCORDING TO THE

00:09:09.949 --> 00:09:14.353
AFFIDAVIT WAS HOME, SAW THE --
WHO WE BELIEVE WAS THE SUSPECT,

00:09:14.353 --> 00:09:16.789
RIGHT, BUT THEN THERE WERE NO
CALLS FOR EIGHT HOURS AND HIM

00:09:16.789 --> 00:09:19.859
JUST SAYING, LOOK, THIS IS NOT A
MOVIE.

00:09:19.859 --> 00:09:23.162
THIS IS JUST, YOU KNOW, YOU HAVE
TO TRY TO PUT YOURSELF IN THAT

00:09:23.162 --> 00:09:23.863
MOMENT.
&gt;&gt; YEAH.

00:09:23.863 --> 00:09:26.365
&gt;&gt; I THINK IT JUST SPEAKS TO --
SPEAKS TO WHO HE IS.

00:09:26.365 --> 00:09:28.067
&gt;&gt; GOOD FOR HIM FOR SAYING THAT.
AS HE SAID, PETRIFIED.

00:09:28.067 --> 00:09:32.438
AS HE SAID, PETRIFIED.
THIS IS A GIRL JUST OUT OF HER

00:09:32.438 --> 00:09:36.208
TEENAGE YEARS WHO WITNESSED --
JUST YOU CAN IMAGINE THE FEAR IN

00:09:36.208 --> 00:09:38.644
THAT MOMENT.
ANYWAY, WE WILL KEEP ON THE

00:09:38.644 --> 00:09:39.679
STORY.
A LOT MORE TO COME.

